# Open Dungeon Master workspace rules

Read AGENTS.md at this repository root. The ODM source root is this directory,
not an additional open-dungeon-master/ subdirectory. Dependency versions and
available scripts come from package.json and the lockfiles.

For external-DM work read .opencode/skills/odm-narrator/SKILL.md and the live
odm://narrator/playbook resource. Preserve authoritative engine outcomes, drained
cursors, private Ask/whisper boundaries, RU/EN/PL UI and independent narration
language. Never automatically replay an ambiguous write or reapply engine damage.

Code integration does not authorize production access or deployment. Do not copy
secrets into source, logs or command arguments. Keep current transaction/CAS,
MCP cancellation/preload, network and operations protections when merging old work.

Run affected tests and report their exact scope. Source/registry test doubles are
not a full Next build, browser session, installed MCP SDK or deployment acceptance.
See docs/merge-2026-09-17.md for the current reconciliation and test record.
